=\"ja\">はら.む・みごも.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妊娠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にんしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妊娠；怀孕；受孕</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">熟</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>成熟；熟练；（果实）成熟</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">熟語</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅくご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">汉字复合词；汉字组合词；习语；惯用语；成语</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">成熟</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいじゅく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">成熟；成熟度</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">未熟</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みじゅく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">未成熟；青涩；幼稚；不成熟；缺乏经验；生疏；青涩</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">旭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>旭日；朝阳</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あさひ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">恩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>恩惠；好意；慈悲；恩情；恩典</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">恩</span><